<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="GAL" style="id">- Saafi-Saafi</book>
  <para style="h">Ɓi Galaat</para>
  <para style="toc3">Gal</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ɓi Galaat</para>
  <para style="toc1">Fiisi Pool kaɓɗoh ɓi Galaat</para>
  <para style="mt">Fiisi Pool kaɓɗoh ɓi Galaat</para>
  <para style="is">Rangsohaani</para>
  <para style="ip">Pool ɓaahee ŋ Israayel ci, ŋ cuuɓiŋ Benyaamin.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 11:1">Ɓi Rom 11:1</ref>; <ref loc="PHP 3:5">Ɓi Filippi 3:5</ref></char></note> A nikee <char style="w"><char style="tl">Farisen</char></char>.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 23:6">Tum ci 23:6</ref>; <ref loc="PHP 3:5">Ɓi Filippi 3:5</ref></char></note> Ŋ finho <char style="w">Paantakot</char>, wi Janguuni camb ɓaatuk, a ɓaahee ŋ ɓi tolfiɗee kosiɗ ci.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:58-8:3">Tum ci 7:58–8:3</ref></char></note> Waaye wa raakka mbeh, a cohha na Yeesu, a kossa<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:1-30">Tum ci 9:1-30</ref></char></note> po a nikka <char style="w"><char style="tl">Apootar</char></char> sah. Teerndiŋ "Tum ciŋ <char style="tl">Apootar</char> ci" teeɓohiɗ pangkiŋ ɗe wi a nik <char style="tl">Apootar</char> ini kooɗoh ŋ saar 13.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ɗiski na woyse Galaat, ca kur laayiɗ nik nga, findi Añcos-Pisidi na Ikoñum na Listar.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:14-14:21">Tum ci 13:14–14:21</ref></char></note> Kon Pool fiis kaɓɗohii ɓi kur laayiɗ. Ɓo' amb ne a fiis kaɓɗohii ŋ finho ɓaaɓiŋ ɗe yakki koc,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13-14">Tum ci 13–14</ref></char></note> wi a tufkiɗoh ɓi Jangu ngaŋ Galaat, waaye wa yooɓɗi inhu findi wa kaɗoh. Ŋ saar 2, aaya 1-10, raakiɗ kaɗiŋ ɗe ŋ Yerusalem a naandsuk. Wa miniɗ nik ne weɗ kaɗi nam naandsuku ŋ teerndiŋ Tum ciŋ Apootar ci, ŋ saar 11:27-30 na 12:25, mbaa wa raak ɗe cohɗi na ɓi Galaat paaɗ. Kon nik ne wa kaɗoh ɗaa ɗah, wa miniɗ nik ne a fiis kaɓɗohii ŋ harmban ɓaaɓiŋ ɗe yakki koc na wi kanakɗoh.</para>
  <para style="ip">Pool fiisiɗ kaɓɗohii sagu ne, a kerheen ne raakiɗ ɓi ɓo' ɓi ɓekee ŋ haf ciŋ ɓi Galaat "yegɗoh muc wiiriis". A waaɗeeɗi ne ɓa faɗ kosi ɓa kos Yeesu, a woytoheeɗa ɓa.</para>
  <para style="iot">Fiisi Pool kaɓɗoh ɓi Galaat kaɗtiɗoh an :</para>
  <para style="io1">- Pool kañɗiɗ ɓi Galaat te a teeɓiɗ ɓa ne a <char style="tl">Apootar</char> <char style="ior"><ref loc="GAL 1:1-5">1:1-5</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- "yegɗoh muc wiiriis" <char style="ior"><ref loc="GAL 1:6-10">1:6-10</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- <char style="w">Yegɗohiŋ Muci</char> Pool na yegɗohe puloh ŋ Kooh <char style="ior"><ref loc="GAL 1:11-2:10">1:11–2:10</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Pool degiɗ Piyeer ŋ waas <char style="ior"><ref loc="GAL 2:11-21">2:11-21</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Teeɓoh ne Yegɗohiŋ Muci keeh <char style="ior"><ref loc="GAL 3:1-4:7">3:1–4:7</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Raak haf fu ŋ <char style="w" lemma="Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh">Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani</char>, waaye ŋ nakoh ci haa <char style="ior"><ref loc="GAL 4:8-5:26">4:8–5:26</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Nakoh pes ŋ waaɗ morom fu <char style="ior"><ref loc="GAL 6:1-10">6:1-10</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Dengkoh ci mirndoh <char style="ior"><ref loc="GAL 6:11-18">6:11-18</ref></char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="GAL 1" />
  <para style="s">Kañɗohi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-2" style="v" sid="GAL 1:1-2" />Mi yii kañiɗ ɗu, ɗu ɓi Janguuciŋ Galaat, ñam Pool, <char style="tl"><char style="w" lemma="apootar">Apootari</char></char> ɓo' woosɗi, yi ɓo' tufkiɗɗi, waaye a Yeesu <char style="w">Kiristaa</char> na Kooh Baabi woos so, Kooh yi hultiɗ ɗe. Mi na ɓaah ciŋ ɓoo kosiɗ ci nik na so jen, ɓoo ɓii kañiɗ ɗu. <verse eid="GAL 1:1-2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 1:3" />Kooh Baabiŋ ɓoo, baahohaat ɗu, a on ɗu jam ; Yeesu Kiristaa Heɗi baahohaat ɗu, a on ɗu jam ! <verse eid="GAL 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 1:4" />Yeesu Kiristaa, a yi eɗoh haf ce wuu bakaaɗ ciŋ ɓoo, ne a puliɗ ɓoo ŋ adinaani baahaaɗiinii, te weɗ ini Kooh Baabiŋ ɓoo waaɗ, <verse eid="GAL 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 1:5" />Kooh yi yakɗaah po faw ! Amiin !<verse eid="GAL 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yegɗoh Muc yino dong raak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 1:6" />Ŋ feyuuɗ lool ŋ ini ɗu na are eɗ finho Yi ɓeeɗuk ɗu ngaŋ baahohiŋ Kiristaani, po ɗu kee taambɗa "yegɗoh muc" wiiriis. <verse eid="GAL 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 1:7" />Keeh-keeh, yegɗoh muc wiiriis raakɗi. Raak ɓooɓi na yahrohe liiɓ ciŋ ɗu, ɓa waaɗ ɓoƴsoh <char style="w">Yegɗohiŋ Muci</char>, wi kaɗ ŋ Kiristaani. <verse eid="GAL 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 1:8" />Waaye ali ɓo' nga ɓoo wala malaaka puloh Eel ci sah woo ɗu yegɗoh muc wiiriis, ɗalohiɗ na wi ɓoo woo ɗu ɗah, a alku'aat ! <verse eid="GAL 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 1:9" />Ɓoo woyeena, te mi yii woyisa : Ɓo' woo ɗu yegɗoh muc ɗalohiɗ na wi ɗu rahas ɗah, a alku'aat ! <verse eid="GAL 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 1:10" />Andi mi na waake ne ɓooɓi neɓu nga so ? Wala mi na waake ne Kooh neɓu nga so ? Andi mi na waake ini neɓ ɓooɓi ? Ŋ waakeen ini neɓ ɓooɓi poyi ɗah, ŋ heeɗi nike <char style="w" lemma="ñaam">ñaamiŋ</char> Kiristaani.<verse eid="GAL 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Findi Pool nikoh <char style="tl">Apootar</char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 1:11" />Ɓaah ciŋ ngo, mi yii inhiɗ ɗu ne Yegɗohiŋ Muci ŋ yegɗoh, wa liiɓ ɓo' haa, <verse eid="GAL 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 1:12" />mi ŋ haf fo ŋ rahsohɗi wa ŋ ɓo' te ɓo' jangiɗɗi so wa, waaye Yeesu Kiristaa a yi teeɓ po wa.<verse eid="GAL 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 1:13" />Ɗu kerhiɗ findi ŋ mandee ɗeɓgaan, wa ŋ nik ŋ waasiŋ Yawuut ci : Ŋ meeɗ meeɗ tolfiɗ ɓi Janguuniŋ Kooh tolfiɗ miskiɗ ne ŋ ɗumba. <verse eid="GAL 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 1:14" />Ŋ waasiŋ Yawuut ci, ñam saandee ɓo' laayiɗ ŋ gomal ciŋ ngo, ñam uupee ɓa sawar ŋ mbaah ciŋ caac ciŋ ɓoo.<verse eid="GAL 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 1:15" />Waaye ŋ baahohiŋ Kooh, a waɗkiɗ to wa ŋ nik ŋ rookaŋ yaay ɓoo, a ɓeeɗukka so ne ŋ pangkiɗ ɗe. Wa wa neɓ ɗe, <verse eid="GAL 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 1:16" />a teeɓiɗ to <char style="w" lemma="Kuɓkiŋ Kooh">Kuɓkiŋ ɗe</char> ne ŋ woo ɓi nikɗi Yawuut Yegɗohiŋ Muci ŋ ini kaɗ nga ɗe. Ŋ ineem, ŋ meekisɗi ali ɓo', <verse eid="GAL 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 1:17" />ŋ kaɗɗi sah Yerusalem ne ŋ marak ɓi koc co nik <char style="tl">Apootar</char>, ŋ jaar kaɗ Arabi, ŋ dokukka Damas.<verse eid="GAL 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 1:18" />Wa degga kiis kaahay, ŋ kaɗta Yerusalem ne ŋ inhoh na Piyeer, ŋ nikka ɗiskaŋ ɗe neeh ndaŋkiyaah na yatuus (15). <verse eid="GAL 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 1:19" />Waaye ŋ hotɗi ali <char style="tl">Apootar</char> wiiriis, ɗal Saak, taambɗoh Heɗi. <verse eid="GAL 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 1:20" />Ini ŋ fiisiɗ ɗu weem, Kooh yi tiimb mbo inhiɗ ne ŋ leyɗi.<verse eid="GAL 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 1:21" />Ƴutta ŋ kaɗta kur caŋ Siri na Silisi. <verse eid="GAL 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 1:22" />Ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ ɓi Janguuciŋ Kiristaani nik ŋ Yudee, ɓa inheeɗi so. <verse eid="GAL 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 1:23" />Ɓa kerhee ɓooɓi woyee rek ne : « Ƴaari meeɗ ɓoo tolfiɗ, a na yegɗohe kotii Yegɗohiŋ Muci ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ kosi a jeemee yahroh. » <verse eid="GAL 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 1:24" />Ɓa yakiɗta Kooh ŋ ini kaɗ nga so.<verse eid="GAL 1:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="GAL 2" />
  <para style="s">Pool na <char style="tl">Apootar</char> ci ɓinooɓi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 2:1" />Wa wa deg kiis ndaŋkiyaah na kiis nikiis (14), ŋ dokukka Yerusalem, mi na Barnabaas, ŋ nammba ɓayndoh ɓaah ɓoo Tit. <verse eid="GAL 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 2:2" />Ŋ kaɗta nga laam e Kooh teeɓee so ne ŋ joyiɗa tum. Ŋ teeɓpa ɓa <char style="w">Yegɗohiŋ Muci</char>, wi ŋ woo ɓi nikɗi Yawuut ; ŋ ɗaayee na ɓooɓa uupee eɗu cir, ŋ woosa ɓa wa, ŋ waaɗeeɗi ne pangkiŋ ngo wotɓa na woti nik ɓarang ɓarang.<verse eid="GAL 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 2:3" />Waaye wa jam dong raakee, Tit sah, yi hunee na so, a nikee <char style="w">Gerek</char>, te Gerek ci na nguɗkeeɗi. Moona ɓa wooɗi ɗe ne a <char style="w">nguɗuk</char>. <verse eid="GAL 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 2:4" />Hanaa ɓi woyee ne ɓa ɓaah ciŋ ɓoo te ɓa nikɗaa, ɓi ɗembee aassa ŋ ɗooƴ ɓoo ne ɓa marak raaki ɓoo raak haf ɓoo ŋ niki ɓoo nik ŋ <char style="w" lemma="Kiristaa">Kiristaani</char> Yeesu ; ɓa tumee ineem ne ɓa tonduk nga, ɓa tum ɓoo <char style="w">ñaam</char>. <verse eid="GAL 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 2:5" />Ɓoo teyɗukiɗɗi ɓa wa waas yino, ɓoo waaɗee ne keeh kiŋ Yegɗohiŋ Muci ris nga ɗu.<verse eid="GAL 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 2:6" />Ini kaɗ ŋ ɓi ambsee findi ɓooɓi uup eɗu cir - tiik nu ɓa mineen raak ɗah, wa bugulɗi so, Kooh na markeeɗi ŋ ɓoyi ŋ findi a mand ! - Ɓooɓi eɗu cir ɓeem, ɓa degɗi so ali in. <verse eid="GAL 2:6" /><verse number="7-9" style="v" sid="GAL 2:7-9" />Saak na Piyeer na Saaŋ kay hot hot ne ŋ dengkohuuɗ ne ŋ woo ɓi nikɗi Yawuut Yegɗohiŋ Muci, findi Piyeer dengkohu ne a woo Yawuut ci Yegɗohiŋ Muci. Laam, Yi na ambohe Piyeer ŋ <char style="tl"><char style="w" lemma="apootar">ki'apootarkiŋ</char></char> ɗe ŋ Yawuut ci, a yi nam mbo amboh ŋ <char style="tl">ki'apootarkiŋ</char> ngo ŋ ɓi nikɗi Yawuut. Wa ɓa hot baahohi ŋ baahohu, ɓeɗ ɓi ambsee findi ɓi adgoh Janguuni, ɓa eɗta ɓoo yaah, mi na Barnabaas, ne ɓoo nik yino na ɓa. Ɓoo kerhiɗohha ne ɓoo hey kaɗe ŋ ɓi nikɗi Yawuut, ɓeɗ ɓa kaɗ ŋ Yawuut ci ; <verse eid="GAL 2:7-9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 2:10" />ɓa nakee ɓoo dong ne ɓoo faɗoh nof ñakiɗ ci, te ineem, mi yii tuma poyi keeh-keeh.<verse eid="GAL 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pool woytohiɗ Piyeer</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 2:11" />Waaye wa Piyeer hay Añcos, ŋ woo ɗe jahran ne ŋ hunɗi ŋ tumohaaɗiŋ ɗe, sagu ne a nikeeɗi ŋ keeh. <verse eid="GAL 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 2:12" />Laam, bala ɓi ɓo' ɓaah ŋ ɓi Saak hayan ɗah, a meeɗ meeɗ ɓaah kañam na kosiɗ ci nikɗi Yawuut ; waaye wa ɓa ree, a cammba nooksuk, a ñamisɗi na ɓa, sagu neƴƴoh Yawuut ci kosiɗ ci risee taambiɗ mbaah ciŋ ɓa. <verse eid="GAL 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 2:13" />Yawuut ci kosiɗ ci ɓinooɓi hunnda na Piyeer ŋ naafeehaakiŋ ɗe, po ɓa kaɓpaa sah Barnabaas.<verse eid="GAL 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 2:14" />Waaye, wa ŋ hot ne ɓa kooɗɗi waas yurhiɗ, wi hun na keeh kiŋ Yegɗohiŋ Muci, ŋ woosa Piyeer ŋ fiki kosiɗ ci jen ne : « Fu yi Yawuut, fu na pese findi ɓi ɓaah ŋ cuuɓ ci cinooci, waaye findi Yawuut haa. Fu min na hiiroh kosiɗ ciŋ cuuɓ ci cinooci ne ɓa pes findi Yawuut ?<verse eid="GAL 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 2:15" />Ɓoo rimuk Yawuut, ɓoo ɓaahɗi ŋ cuuɓ ci cinooci na bakaaɗe. <verse eid="GAL 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 2:16" />Waaye ɓoo inhiɗ ne Kooh na ambeeɗi ɓo' findi yurhiɗ taamboh ŋ tum in ci <char style="w" lemma="waasiŋ Musaa">waasiŋ</char> <char style="w">Musaa</char> nakoh, waaye taamboh ŋ kosi a kos Yeesu Kiristaa. Ɓoo ŋ haf ɓoo, ɓoo namiɗ kos Kiristaani Yeesu findi ɓi nikɗi Yawuut, ne ɓoo onu kiyurhi puloh ŋ kosi ɓoo kos ɗe. Wa pulohɗi ŋ taambiɗ nakoh ciŋ waasi, laam Kooh ambanɗi ali ɓo' findi yurhiɗ sagu taambiɗ ini waasi nakoh.<verse eid="GAL 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 2:17" />Waaye, nik ne ɓoo na waake onu kiyurah ŋ niki ɓoo nik ŋ Kiristaani ɗah, wa na teeɓohe ne ɓoo nam nik bakaaɗoh. Andi ineem tokis ne Kiristaani na pangkiɗe bakaaɗ ? Muk ! <verse eid="GAL 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 2:18" />Ŋ tufkiɗissee nakoh ciŋ waasi ŋ faɗee ɗah, ŋ ineem mi na teeɓohe ne mi na ɗale waas.<verse eid="GAL 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 2:19" />Laam waasi tahiɗ po ŋ ini kaɗ nga, ŋ kaaniɗ, ne ŋ min pes wuu Kooh. Ŋ daaƴuuɗ ŋ kurwaana na Kiristaani. <verse eid="GAL 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 2:20" />A mi na pese kotii haa, a Kiristaani na pese nga so. Kipes kiŋ ɓoyi ŋ nikoh, mi na pesee wa na kos <char style="w">Kuɓkiŋ Kooh</char>, yi waaɗ to, po a eɗohha haf ce wuu so.<verse eid="GAL 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 2:21" />Ɗu hotiɗ ne mi na heefeeɗi baahohiŋ Kooh ; nikee ne taambiɗ waasi na tahe ɓo' ambu findi yurhiɗ ŋ fiki Kooh ɗah, kon Kiristaani kaan ŋ ɓarang ɓarang. »<verse eid="GAL 2:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="GAL 3" />
  <para style="s">Naandi ɓi Galaat naand</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 3:1" />Cey ɗu ɓi Galaat, e ɗu naand ! Ya ɓa honjom ɗu ? Te ŋ hot ɗu teeɓuuɗ, findi nataal, Yeesu <char style="w">Kiristaa</char> daaƴuuɗ ŋ kurwaa. <verse eid="GAL 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 3:2" />Inii dong weɗ ŋ waaɗ ne ɗu lof fo nga : Andi taambiɗ nakoh ciŋ waasi weɗ tah ɗu rahas <char style="w" lemma="Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh">Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani</char> wala ɗu kerah <char style="w">Yegɗohiŋ Muci</char>, ɗu kossa weɗ tah ? <verse eid="GAL 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 3:3" />Ɗu naandoha naandoh jen e ? Ɗu camb na Fuuɗsi po ƴut, ɗu kee reehɗoha kotii na tumohaaɗ ciŋ ɗu haf ɗu e ? <verse eid="GAL 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 3:4" />In ci ɗu jang ŋ taamb-taamb ciŋ ɗu jen, ca ɓarang ɓarang e ? Wa minɗi nik ɓarang ɓarang kay ! <verse eid="GAL 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 3:5" />Yi eɗ ɗu Fuuɗsi te a tumee ŋ ɗooƴ ɗu in feyohiɗ, andi a na tume ineem taamboh ŋ tiindohaaɗ ciŋ waasi wala ŋ kosi ɗu kos Yegɗohiŋ Muci ɗu kerah ?<verse eid="GAL 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuɓuuciŋ Ibrahiima taamboh ŋ kos, ɓeɗ rahas barkeeni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 3:6" />Marka Ibrahiima rek ; fiis ci woo ne : « Ibrahiima kossa Kooh, weɗ tah a ambuusa ne a ɓo' yurhiɗ. »<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:6">Camba 15:6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GAL 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 3:7" />Kon inhaat inii : Ɓi kos Kooh, ɓeɗ ambu findi kuɓu Ibrahiima. <verse eid="GAL 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 3:8" />Fiis ci woyeen ne Kooh hey one ɓi nikɗi Yawuut kiyurah taamboh ŋ kos, ca nameen woo Ibrahiima ne Yegɗohiŋ Muci hey haye, an : « Cuuɓ ci jen raakohan barke saguufu. »<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:3">Camba 12:3</ref> </char></note> <verse eid="GAL 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 3:9" />Tahha po ɓi kos na barke'ɗasse na Ibrahiima, yi kos.<verse eid="GAL 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 3:10" />Yaa nu gaƴuk ŋ tum nakoh ciŋ waasi ɗah, a alku'iɗ, laam wa fiisuuɗ ne : « Yaa nu genɗi tum in ci fiisu ŋ teerndiŋ waasi jen ɗah, a alku'iɗ ! »<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 27:26">Rohƴiɗi 27:26</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GAL 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 3:11" />Wa raakɗi laam-laam, ali ɓo' raakɗi kiyurah ŋ fiki Kooh taamboh ŋ tum nakoh ciŋ waasi, laam Fiis ci woo ne : « Yaa nu yurah ɗah, pesohan kosi a kos. »<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HAB 2:4">Habakuk 2:4</ref> </char></note> <verse eid="GAL 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 3:12" />Waaye ɓoyi gaƴuk ŋ taambiɗ nakoh ciŋ waasi, a gaƴukɗi ŋ kos ; e Fiis ci woo ne : « Yaa nu taambiɗ nakoh ceem ɗah, ceɗ a pesohan. »<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 18:5">Lewiici 18:5</ref></char></note><verse eid="GAL 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 3:13" />Waaye Kiristaani pulɗiɗ ɓoo ŋ alki ɓoo joyee alku sagu waasi, a teyɗukka alku wuu ɓoo, laam wa fiisuuɗ ne : « Yaa nu liku ŋ ndooɗ ɗah, a alku alku. »<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 21:23">Rohƴiɗi 21:23</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GAL 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 3:14" />Ŋ ineem, ɓi nikɗi Yawuut raakoh barkeeni Ibrahiima gapse taamboh ŋ Yeesu Kiristaa. Te ɓoo jen, ɓoo taamboh ŋ kos, ɓoo rahassa Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani Kooh gapoh.<verse eid="GAL 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nakoh ciŋ waasi, ca minɗi nihis gapohi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 3:15" />Ɓaah ciŋ ngo, mi na woye findi ɓo' na woyohe : Ɓo' sah, a hee kurkohe nga, a dengkoh finhooce po ƴut ɗah, ali ɓo' minɗaa nihis wala a ɓaat in nga. <verse eid="GAL 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 3:16" />Kooh raakiɗ ini a gap Ibrahiima na tisohiŋ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Marka teerndiŋ </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 13:15">Camba 13:15</ref></char>. Ɓoo marak ŋ teerndiŋ Camba ɗah, ɓoo na hote ne wa fiisu "ɓi rimkoh nga ɗe". Waaye ŋ peɗeem heber, wa fiisu "tisohiŋ ɗe". Wa woo nooɗiɗ. Wa tokis "ɓi rimkoh nga ɗe", waaye wa namee waaɗ woo ne a ɓo' yino dong, Kiristaani.</note> ɗe. Te sah, ɓo' miniɗ hot ne, wa wooɗi "tisoh ciŋ ɗe", waaye "tisohiŋ ɗe". Kon, wa yino dong, te tisoheem, a Kiristaani. <verse eid="GAL 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 3:17" />Inii weɗ ŋ waaɗ woo : Kooh tufkiɗiɗ ambtiɗohiŋ ɗe po ƴutiɗ in maañiɗ, wa yakohiɗ <char style="w" lemma="waasiŋ Musaa">waasiŋ</char> <char style="w">Musaa</char> kiis teemet-nikiis na kiis ndaŋkiyaah-kaahay (430), kon waasi minɗaa nihis po gapohi kee nika ɓarang ɓarang. <verse eid="GAL 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 3:18" />Ini ɓoo joy lam pulohee ŋ taambiɗ nakoh ciŋ waasi ɗah, wa heeɗi pulohisse ŋ gapohi ; te moona, e gapohi on Ibrahiima ini Kooh baahoh ɗe.<verse eid="GAL 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Waasi etohu ye ?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 3:19" />Kon waasi etohu ye ? Wa ɓaatsee ŋ gapohi ne wa teeɓohee ɗal ci po findi seti gapu hayohan ; Kooh deg ineem ŋ yaah ɓoyi nikee ŋ harmban ce na ɓooɓi, taamboh ŋ malaakaaci. <verse eid="GAL 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 3:20" />Wa Kooh na gape Ibrahiima, a nikee kiik ce. A etoheeɗi ne ɓo' nik ŋ harmban ce na in wiiriis.<verse eid="GAL 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 3:21" />Kon andi waasi hunɗi na gapoh ciŋ Kooh ? Aha'kay ! Nikee ne ɓo' rahsiɗ nakoh miniɗ on ɓo' kipes ɗah, kon ee, taambiɗ waas heen mine on ɓo' kiyurah ŋ fiki Kooh. <verse eid="GAL 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 3:22" />Waaye wa na kaɗoheeɗi ɗaa, laam Fiis ci teeɓohiɗ ne bakaaɗ degiɗ ɓooɓi jen yaah, wa rannga ɓa. Ineem raakiɗ ne ɓi kos min rahas ini gapohse taamboh ŋ kosi ɓa kos Yeesu Kiristaa.<verse eid="GAL 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 3:23" />Bala kosi hayan, ɓoo nikee ambuuɗ, waasi taƴca ɓoo ne ɓoo sek mbehi kosi teeɓohsan. <verse eid="GAL 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 3:24" />Waasi weɗ nikee niiɗohiŋ ɓoo, wa ɓendeeɗa ɓoo ŋ Kiristaa, ne ɓoo taamboh ŋ kosi, ɓoo onu kiyurah. <verse eid="GAL 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 3:25" />Wi kosi hay, niiɗoh yilfisɗi ɓoo.<verse eid="GAL 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 3:26" />Ɗu jen, kosi tahiɗ po ɗu kuɓu Kooh ŋ niki ɗu nik ŋ Kiristaani Yeesu. <verse eid="GAL 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GAL 3:27" />Ɗu ɓi ɓoktu ŋ Kiristaani jen, ɗu ɓekkiɗ mandohaaɗiŋ ɗe findi kulɓa. <verse eid="GAL 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GAL 3:28" />Wa Yawuut haa, wa nikaaɗi Yawuut haa, wa <char style="w">ñaam</char> haa, wa raakiɗ haf ce haa, wa ƴaar haa, wa ɓitiɓ haa, ɗu jen ɗu yino ŋ niki ɗu nik ŋ Kiristaani Yeesu. <verse eid="GAL 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GAL 3:29" />Nik ne ɗu ɓaah ŋ Kiristaani ɗah, ɗu ɓaah ŋ ɓi rimkoh ŋ Ibrahiima, te ɗu hey lame findi wa gapohu.<verse eid="GAL 3:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="GAL 4" />
  <para style="s">Ɓoo nikisɗi ñaam, ɓoo kuɓu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 4:1" />Te inii weɗ ŋ woo : Lamohi, feeh a komaaki ƴin ɗah, a na <char style="w" lemma="ñaam">ñaami</char>, ɓa ɗalohɗi ali in, ali nik ne sah, a yi raak lamaahi jen. <verse eid="GAL 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 4:2" />A na nike ŋ yaah ɓooɓi na taambkohee ɗe na raak-raak kiŋ ɗe po ŋ jamanooni baabi woyoha. <verse eid="GAL 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 4:3" />Wa mand ɗaa nga ɓoo. Wa ɓoo nik ƴin, ɓoo nikee ñaam ciŋ in ci na tiindɗe Adina.<verse eid="GAL 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 4:4" />Waaye wi jamanooniŋ wa ree, Kooh woossa <char style="w" lemma="Kuɓkiŋ Kooh">Kuɓkiŋ ɗe</char>, yi rimkoh ŋ ɓitiɓ, te wi a rimuk, a <char style="w" lemma="waasiŋ Musaa">waasiŋ</char> <char style="w">Musaa</char> yilfee ɗe, <verse eid="GAL 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 4:5" />ne a on ɓi waasi yilif, ɓa raak haf ɓa. Jaar ɓoo nik kuɓuuciŋ Kooh. <verse eid="GAL 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 4:6" />Ini teeɓoh ne ɗu kuɓu Kooh weɗ woosi a woos <char style="w" lemma="Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh">Fuuɗsiŋ Kuɓkiŋ ɗe</char> ŋ keeñ ciŋ ɓoo, yi na tahe ɓoo woo an : « <char style="tl">Abba</char> ! Baab ! » <verse eid="GAL 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 4:7" />Ŋ ineem, fu nikisɗi ñaam, fu kuɓu ; te nik ne fu kuɓu ɗah, fu hey rahse in ci Kooh gap kuɓuuciŋ ɗe.<verse eid="GAL 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pool jaahɗiɗ ŋ mandohaaɗiŋ ɓi Galaat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 4:8" />Ɗeɓgaan, ɗu inheeɗi Kooh, ɗu nikee ñaam ciŋ kooh ci nikaaɗiici. <verse eid="GAL 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 4:9" />Waaye ɗiski wa nik ɗu inhiɗ Kooh - te ini uup raak njiriñ sah, weɗ ne Kooh inhohiɗ na ɗu - ɗu min na wiirkoh ŋ in ci na tiindɗe Adina, ci raakaaɗi hatil na njiriñ ceem, po ɗu waaɗee nikis ñaam ciŋ ca ? <verse eid="GAL 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 4:10" />Ɗu ɓii yakiɗ ɓi mbeh, na ɓi caɓin na ɓi kiis na ɓi jamano, ɗu liiɓ haa ne ɗu joya joy tum ! <verse eid="GAL 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 4:11" />Ŋ neƴƴohiɗ ne yaaɓi ŋ yaaɓee nga ɗu jen nik ɓarang ɓarang.<verse eid="GAL 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 4:12" />Ŋ kiim ɗu wa kiim ɓaah ciŋ ngo, mandaat na so, findi ŋ mandee na ɗu wa ŋ nik na ɗu. Ɗu ɗalɗi so waas yino. <verse eid="GAL 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 4:13" />Ɗu inhiɗa, a kosaay ɓayee so nga ɗu wa ŋ koc ɗu woo <char style="w">Yegɗohiŋ Muci</char>. <verse eid="GAL 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 4:14" />Moona kosaay keem mineen tah po ɗu heef fo, wala ɗu sepeƴnuk ko, waaye ɗu tumɗaa ; ɗu teyɗuk ko teyɗuk moɗoɗ po haa ŋ malaaka, po haa ñam <char style="w" lemma="Kiristaa">Kiristaani</char> Yeesu. <verse eid="GAL 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 4:15" />Waam, ɗu sumeen ! Mi yii seede ne wa mineen nik ɗah, ɗu heen nihse has ciŋ ɗu, ɗu eɗ to ca. Wa ye rahas ɗu ŋ harmbani ?<verse eid="GAL 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 4:16" />Ini ŋ woo ɗu keeh joyiɗ tah po ŋ nik sangiɗiŋ ɗu e ? <verse eid="GAL 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 4:17" />Ɓooɓi sawar nga ɗu ɓeem, liiɓohaaɗ ciŋ ɓa baahɗi. Ɓa waaɗ ɗu saɓsoh na ɓoo, ne ɗu sawar nga ɓa. <verse eid="GAL 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 4:18" />Wa in baahiɗ ne ɗu gen raak ɓooɓi sawaran nga ɗu, ali ŋ nikɗi nga sah, waaye wa nikaat ne a in baahiɗ taha kuruk.<verse eid="GAL 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 4:19" />Kuɓuuciŋ ngo, ɗu tahiɗ po mi yii raakis miskiɗ findi ɓitɓi na ɓasle, te wa genan gen po mbaɗna mandohaaɗiŋ Kiristaani rimkan nga ɗu. <verse eid="GAL 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 4:20" />Ŋ mineen ɗah, ŋ hee nikee ŋ ɗooƴ ɗu kotii, ne ŋ uup min woo na ɗu baahiɗ, laam, ŋ inhisɗi findi ŋ tuman na ɗu.<verse eid="GAL 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuɓu ñaam na kuɓu gor</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 4:21" />Woyaat to, ɗu ɓi waaɗ ne waasiŋ Musaa yilif ɗu, ɗu kerahɗi ini waasi na woye e ? <verse eid="GAL 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 4:22" />Wa woo ne Ibrahiima raakee kuɓu kanak, yinni rimkoh ŋ ñaam, yinoori rimkohha ŋ gor.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 16">Camba 16</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 17">17</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 21">21</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GAL 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 4:23" />Waaye yi ñaami rim, a rimuk findi ɓo' na rimkohe, te yi gori rim, a rimuk ŋ gapohiŋ Kooh. <verse eid="GAL 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 4:24" />Ineem raakiɗ ini wa waaɗ woo : Ɓitiɓ ci kanak ceem ɓa nikiɗ findi <char style="w" lemma="Ambtiɗohi Koc na wi Asi">ambtiɗoh kanak</char>. Yinoori, a yi ambtiɗohi tufkiɗohu tangooraŋ Sinaay,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 19">Pula 19</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 20">20</ref></char></note> a na rime ñaam, a yi Haajara. <verse eid="GAL 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 4:25" />Haajara yeem, a yi tangooraŋ Sinaay, wa nik ŋ Arabi - te a yi nam nik Yerusalemi woti-woti, wa ñaam, wa na kuɓuuciŋ wa jen. <verse eid="GAL 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 4:26" />Waaye Yerusalemaŋ ɗafka raakiɗ haf wa, te weɗ yaayiŋ ɓoo.<verse eid="GAL 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GAL 4:27" />Wa fiisuuɗ ne :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GAL 4:27">« Suma, fu yi ɓitɓi jaasir,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GAL 4:27">fu yi raakɗi kuɓu !</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GAL 4:27">Leehka sagu sum,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GAL 4:27">fu yi moosɗi yegoh</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GAL 4:27">miskiɗ ciŋ ɓasil !</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GAL 4:27">Kuɓuuciŋ ɓitɓi faɗu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GAL 4:27">ɓeɗ uupan laay</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GAL 4:27">ɓiŋ ɓitɓi nik na ƴaar ce. »<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 54:1">Esayi 54:1</ref></char></note><verse eid="GAL 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GAL 4:28" />Ini kaɗ nga ɗu, ɓaah ciŋ ngo, ɗu kuɓuuciŋ gapohi findi Isaahha. <verse eid="GAL 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GAL 4:29" />Waaye ŋ jamanoonaam, kuɓki rimuk findi ɓo' na rimkohe, meeɗeen tolfiɗ yi rimuk ŋ tumohaaɗ ciŋ <char style="w" lemma="Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh">Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani</char>, te wa mand ɗaa woti. <verse eid="GAL 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GAL 4:30" />Waaye Fiis ci woo ye nga ? Ca woo ne : « Aaña ñaami na kuɓkiŋ ɗe, laam, kuɓkiŋ ñaami joyɗi lam na kuɓkiŋ gori. »<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 21:10">Camba 21:10</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GAL 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GAL 4:31" />Mbaa ɓaah ciŋ ngo, ɓoo kuɓu ñaam haa, ɓoo kuɓu gor.<verse eid="GAL 4:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="GAL 5" />
  <para style="s">Kinaat dokkis ɗu nikis ñaam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 5:1" />
    <char style="w" lemma="Kiristaa">Kiristaani</char> naafiɗ ɓoo ne ɓoo raak haf ɓoo. Kon, ndengɗukaat, te kinaat dokkis ɗu nikis <char style="w">ñaam</char>. <verse eid="GAL 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 5:2" />Sikɗukaat to ! Mi yi Pool, ñam na woyee ɗu wa : Ɗu teyɗuk <char style="w" lemma="nguɗuk">nguɗu</char> ɗah, Kiristaani heyɗi ɗu raakɗisse njiriñ. <verse eid="GAL 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 5:3" />Te mi woytohis ɓo' nu teyɗuk nguɗu ɗah : Ɓoyeem inhaat ne a joy joy taambiɗ nakoh ciŋ waasi findi ca hend jen. <verse eid="GAL 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 5:4" />Ɗu ɓi na waake kiyurah taamboh ŋ nakoh ciŋ waasi, ɗu saɓsohuuɗ na Kiristaani ; ɗu ñakiɗ baahohiŋ Kooh.<verse eid="GAL 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 5:5" />Ɓoo nak, e <char style="w" lemma="Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh">Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani</char> on ɓoo oolki ɓoo ooluk ne Kooh hey ɓoo one kiyurah taamboh ŋ kosi ɓoo kos, te ɓoo ɓii seka na seesuk. <verse eid="GAL 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 5:6" />Ini raak njiriñ ngaŋ ɓi nik ŋ Kiristaani Yeesu, wa nguɗuk haa, wa nguɗkaaɗi haa, wa kosi na tume sagu waaɗoh.<verse eid="GAL 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 5:7" />Ɗu nikee ŋ waas baahiɗ ! Ya ɓa tufkiɗ ɗu, po a hondohha ɗu kerhiɗ keeh ki ? <verse eid="GAL 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 5:8" />Ini ɓek ɗu ŋ inii pulohɗi ŋ Kooh yi ɓeeɗuk ɗu. <verse eid="GAL 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 5:9" />Findi wa na woyohse : Lawiir ƴissuut na guufɗe muni jen. <verse eid="GAL 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 5:10" />Mi, ŋ oolkiɗ ɗu, ŋ niki ɓoo nik ŋ Heɗi. Ŋ inhiɗ ne ɗu hunan na so. Waaye ɓoyi yahroh hel ciŋ ɗu, ɓo' nu a min ki nik ɗah, Kooh hey ɗe wa wirnde. <verse eid="GAL 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 5:11" />Ɓaah ciŋ ngo, ini kaɗ nga so, nikee ne ŋ ris ɓeeɗkoh nguɗuk ɗah, kon, ŋ heeɗi tolfiɗasse poyi. Mbaa, yegɗohi mi na yegɗohe kakaan kiŋ Kiristaani ŋ kurwaana, heeɗi kafndisse ali ɓo' ! <verse eid="GAL 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 5:12" />Ɓi na ɓaye ɗuuɗ ŋ ɗooƴ ɗu, cey, ɓa mineen nguɗuk po ɓa ɓuc haf ɓa ɗah !<verse eid="GAL 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani na taambiɗ kiñin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 5:13" />Ɗu nak, ɓaah ciŋ ngo, Kooh ɓeeɗkiɗ ɗu ne ɗu raak haf ɗu ; waaye kinaat tonduk ŋ ineem, ɗu taambɗee kiñin ciŋ ɗu ; yaa nu nga ɗu ɗah, waaɗi a waaɗ morom ce tahaat po a taambkohee ɗe. <verse eid="GAL 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 5:14" />Nakoh ciŋ waasi jen, ɓo' miniɗ ca rohƴiɗ ŋ woo yino, an : « Waaɗa morom fu findi fu waaɗoh haf fu. »<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:18">Lewiici 19:18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:25-37">Luk 10:25-37</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GAL 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 5:15" />Waaye ɗu ɗoɓtiɗohe, ɗu sifiñsohtiɗohee ɗah, wortukaat yahrohtiɗoh.<verse eid="GAL 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 5:16" />Inii weɗ ŋ woo : Pesohaat Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, mbaa ɗu taambɗanɗi kiñin ciŋ ɗu. <verse eid="GAL 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 5:17" />Laam, ɓoo taambiɗ kiñin ciŋ ɓoo ɗah, in ci ɓoo waaɗ na ci Fuuɗsi waaɗ suftiɗkoh suftiɗkoh ; waaɗ-waaɗ ci kanak ci suftiɗkoh suftiɗkoh, po ɗu na tumeeɗi ini ɗu waaɗ. <verse eid="GAL 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 5:18" />Waaye ɗu faɗ Fuuɗsi, a adgiɗ ɗu ɗah, nakoh ciŋ waasi yilifɗi ɗu.<verse eid="GAL 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 5:19" />Ɓooɓi jen inhiɗ ini taambiɗ kiñin na rime : Faankoh sangohuuɗ, usɓiɗ haf fu, cakaay, <verse eid="GAL 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 5:20" />ñaamuk kooh ci nikaaɗiici, honjomoh, sangtiɗoh, lahtoh, siisoh, yooɓ ayruk, nook ŋ haf fu, saɓsoh ɓo', ɓek kerhiɗohaaɗi ŋ mboolo, <verse eid="GAL 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 5:21" />siis, [apoh,] laar, mbuumbaay na in ci mand na ca. Findi ŋ woytohee ɗu, mi yii woytohis ɗu : Ɓooɓi na tume in ceem, ɓa raakanɗi ɓak ŋ Nguuriŋ-Kooh.<verse eid="GAL 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 5:22" />Waaye ini Fuuɗsi na rime ŋ ɓoyi, weɗ in cii : Waaɗoh, sum, jam, min muñ seke, baah, haltukoh, car oolku, <verse eid="GAL 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 5:23" />nik ɓo' soosiɗ, min amb haf fu ; ali waas sangɗi in ceem. <verse eid="GAL 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 5:24" />Ɓi ɓaah ŋ Kiristaani Yeesu nak, ɓa daaƴiɗ ŋ kurwaa ini meeɗ ɓa ɓek ŋ taambiɗ kiñin ciŋ ɓa na waaɗ-waaɗ ciŋ ɓa na maɗ-maɗ ciŋ ɓa.<verse eid="GAL 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 5:25" />Ɓoo pesohee Fuuɗsi ɗah, ɓoo namaat taambiɗ Fuuɗsi. <verse eid="GAL 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 5:26" />Ɓoo kinaat hotsiɗuk ; ɓoo faɗaat waak lahtoh, ɓoo kinaat siisoh.<verse eid="GAL 5:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="GAL 6" />
  <para style="s">Ɓaatɗoha morom fu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 6:1" />Ɓaah ciŋ ngo, ɓo' telu tumee ini yurahɗi ɗah, ɗu ɓi na pesohe <char style="w" lemma="Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh">Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani</char>, ɓaatɗohaat ɗe po a dokuk ŋ waas, wa hun na woo soosiɗ. Te yaa nu nga ɗu ɗah, marak haf ce baahiɗ po a namuu kafnduk. <verse eid="GAL 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 6:2" />Yaa nu nga ɗah raankohaat morom ce ɓitki a ɓituk. Ɗu tuma ɗah, ɗu mitiɗ waasiŋ <char style="w" lemma="Kiristaa">Kiristaani</char>. <verse eid="GAL 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 6:3" />Yi amb ne a yi uupiɗ njiriñ, te a ali in haa, a na leye haf ce. <verse eid="GAL 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 6:4" />Yaa nu nga markisaat ini a na tume, a hot ini neɓ ɗe nga ɗah, a neɓsaat, waaye a ɓeesuu wa ŋ ɓinooɓi ; <verse eid="GAL 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 6:5" />in nu ɓo' tum ɗah, a tuma haf ce.<verse eid="GAL 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 6:6" />Yi na jangɗasse woo kiŋ Kooh, eɗaat yi na jangɗee ɗe ngaŋ baahiɗ ci a raak. <verse eid="GAL 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 6:7" />Kinaat lee haf ɗu ; Kooh na njembtasseeɗi. Ini ɓoyi sok, weɗ a nguɗan. <verse eid="GAL 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 6:8" />Yi sok wuu ini neɓ faaniŋ ɗe, nguɗan ini puloh ŋ neɓiɗ ciŋ faaniŋ ɗe, maanaam ɗumbu, waaye yi sok wuu Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, nguɗan ini puloh ŋ Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, maanaam kipes ki heyɗi reehe. <verse eid="GAL 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 6:9" />Ɓoo kinaat yaaɓ ŋ tum in baahiɗ, laam, ɓoo hey nguɗe ŋ jamanooniŋ wa, ne ɓoo faɗsukɗi nga ɗah. <verse eid="GAL 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 6:10" />Mbaa, ɓoo tumɗaat ɓooɓi jen in baahiɗ, ŋ woyisɗi ɗa ɓaah ciŋ ɓoo kosiɗ ci feeh ɓoo ɓii mina ɗah.<verse eid="GAL 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nakoh ci mirndoh na askohi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 6:11" />
    <char style="sig">Ɗu hotiɗ fiis ci yakak ci mi na fiisootee wuu ɗu na yaahiŋ ngo.</char> <verse eid="GAL 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 6:12" /><char style="sig">Ɓi waaɗ hotaat to ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ in ci min hotu, findi ɓa hend jen, ɓeɗ ɓi na woyee ɗu ne ɗu <char style="w">nguɗuk</char>. Ɓa waaɗ in yino dong nga, weɗ ne ɓa sang tolfiɗu sagu kurwaaniŋ Kiristaani.</char> <verse eid="GAL 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 6:13" /><char style="sig">Ɓeɗ ɓi nguɗuk, ŋ haf ɓa sah, ɓa taambiɗɗi <char style="w" lemma="waasiŋ Musaa">waasiŋ</char> <char style="w">Musaa</char> ; waaye ɓa waaɗ ne ɗu nguɗuk ne ɓa min yaksiɗuk nga.</char><verse eid="GAL 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 6:14" />
    <char style="sig">Waaye, ini kaɗ nga so, ŋ heyɗi waake muk yaksiɗkoha ŋ ali in wiiriis ɗal ŋ kurwaaniŋ Heɗ ɓoo Yeesu Kiristaa. Sagu kurwaani, findi ŋ hotoh Adina, wa mand na ini daaƴu ŋ kurwaa, wa raakisɗi njiriñ nga so, te Adina na namee so hotoh ɗaa.</char> <verse eid="GAL 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 6:15" /><char style="sig">Ini raak njiriñ, wa nguɗuk haa, wa nguɗkaaɗi haa, waaye nik feruuɗ as, weɗ raak njiriñ.</char> <verse eid="GAL 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 6:16" /><char style="sig">Jam na yirmoh nikaat na ɓo' nu na taambɗe ini ŋ nakoh wii ɗah, ca nam nik na Israayeliŋ Kooh !</char><verse eid="GAL 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 6:17" />
    <char style="sig">Ini kooɗoh ndii, ali ɓo' kinaat to yaaɓiɗ ; mi, ŋ raak ŋ faaniŋ ngo muuy-gaañ ci teeɓoh ne ŋ ɓaah ŋ Yeesu.</char><verse eid="GAL 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 6:18" />
    <char style="sig">Ɓaah ciŋ ngo, baahohiŋ Heɗ ɓoo Yeesu Kiristaa nikaat na ɗu ! Amiin !</char><verse eid="GAL 6:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 6" />
</usx>